# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Canonicalize www -> apex so joshrutz.com is the single source of truth.
# (Both joshrutz.com and www.joshrutz.com are attached to this Pages project;
#  without this, www would serve a duplicate of the site instead of redirecting.)
https://www.joshrutz.com/* https://joshrutz.com/:splat 301
